IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g7-interpretation`
IMPORT `g7-art21-23-expressions`
IMPORT `g7-tests-fixtures-expressions`

-- g7-tests-expression-traces: the regulative rules of Articles 21 to 23 (SHANT) and the powers of the States and the Minister (MAY), each run against a short history of events.
-- A DEONTIC value cannot be compared in #ASSERT, so every #TRACE has an EXPECT comment right above it, decided from the text before the run, and WORK/check-traces.py checks it:
--   FULFILLED   the prohibition is not live (the entity is registered, or the mental elements are missing, or an exception applies), or the permission has been used;
--   BREACH text the prohibition is live and the forbidden act was done;
--   STANDING    the prohibition is live and nothing forbidden has been done: it stands (no WITHIN: the Law states no period, so the prohibition does not lapse).
-- Scenarios are those of g7-tests-fixtures-expressions (04 strict statement; 05 knowing; 06 knowing, third person; 09 and 10 “charity” by a Jersey entity; 13 to 16 “Jersey charity”; 17 to 21 foreign entity; 33, 34 exceptions).

§ `Part 6 — traces`


